00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.270
Oh well...

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:17.150
Tana-chan's outfit is showing the abundance of beauty.

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:18.790
I'm getting excited!

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:23.500
Senpai!

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:30.000
More! More! More! Watch me more!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:35.100
This is an employee, Hapsiel, who was fired as a teacher and is currently working as a custodian.

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:40.010
By the way, it isn't too late for you
gods to take him back to your realm.

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:41.950
Mysterious goth-loli angel-san

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:44.010
I don't see anything though.

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.480
Neither do I.

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:52.690
Oh, your ignorant, cold eyes are wonderful!

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:56.450
Are you watching? Are you watching me, Metalys?

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.330
Out of the way, commoners!

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:01.500
Hey, is that thing even allowed!?

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.640
This is the true man and machine harmony!

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:04.960
Jagtuniform!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.360
That's a powered suit!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.630
As it is a suit, it is a costume!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:12.890
As it is a costume, then there is no
problem with it being a uniform!

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:19.630
By winning in the MaU-con, everyone will
be forced to accept <i>my</i> golem technology!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:23.820
In short, Professor Sagami's golem technology is history!

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:26.300
You're using this chance to revolt!?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:31.160
Those who oppose me will be deleted!

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.370
I-Idiot! stop!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:51.340
How dare you do that to me?

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.760
Darn it! Tanarotte!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.300
Wait, damn it!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.350
You-!

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:03.010
My ambition ends here.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:04.400
Regrets.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.440
Are you giving up so soon?

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.440
M-Master!

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:12.730
When you give up on going further, it is the end of a magician.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:16.730
As long as you don't give up, I will take your hand.

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:18.410
My young disciple.

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.210
Yes!

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:24.740
Master, I will try my best!

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:27.500
By the way, whom did you call "history"?

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:33.360
It seems like you should begin from the basics again.

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:39.440
Now, it's time for class...

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.770
Ikariya Haruka retires due to educational reasons.

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:48.470
Many others have retired as well.

00:16:55.730 --> 00:17:01.250
The leading group enters the minefield known as the Arsenal of Despair.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:03.200
Anti-personnel mines and claymores,

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.980
even anti-tank mines,

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:07.980
and unreleased eroge.

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:09.690
5,000 mines in total.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:12.300
Will the models be able to come out unharmed?

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:14.750
What are they thinking!?

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:19.070
There's no place to step!

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:22.360
W-What are you doing!

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.460
I've thought of something nice!

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:29.260
After those things blow up, there's no need to worry about stepping on one of them!

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:30.430
You can't be...

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:32.610
Go!!!

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:42.490
I'll be going, then!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.690
D-damn you...

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:45.870
We'll be going!

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:47.710
That is the holy mother?

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:50.380
Shall we say, "Just as expected of her"?

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:58.220
Moe~

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:19.240
Final Transformer Galactical Elephangar!

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:28.580
Oh, old fish!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:34.190
Only a few models remain.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:37.880
It seems like the champion will be from this group.

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.090
Tanarotte!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:40.840
Suzuho!

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:42.880
I have no interest in winning but

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:45.010
it's not fun to let her have the championship.

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:47.160
So take this!

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:48.930
What?

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:53.360
A move I've already seen won't work on me again!

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.860
Are you trying to make a fool out of me?!

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:57.240
Then how about this?

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:07.750
Hey, wait. Stop. Tanarotte!

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.540
Hey, seriously. Stop!

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:15.920
What is this?!

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.660
Our magic is dissapearing!

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.390
W-what is happening?

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:26.990
That whole area was saturated by the models' magic.

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:32.090
But now, with Suzu-chan's powers,
it has changed into a magic vacuum.

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:34.500
Trying to get back the strong
magic power that has been lost,

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:41.410
the surrounding excess magic flowing in the area is reversely pressured by magic.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.740
And, of course, that will cause...

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.530
This!

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:47.540
A magic explosion!

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:54.000
So, everyone with me now!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.060
Good job!

00:19:57.060 --> 00:19:59.310
It's not a good job!

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:00.760
What are you going to do about that?!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.890
Seems like they've used up their magic and health.

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:09.790
Nobody can stand up.

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:12.240
is this all knocked ou-

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:15.010
No, it is not.

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:18.810
The survivor of this fierce battle is number 108

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:21.280
wearing the uniform made by Sakuma Eitarou,

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.360
Eineus the Vergest.

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:25.100
Sempai...?

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:28.030
Didn't I say that I will participate if I felt like it.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:32.000
Now that my ambitions have been fulfilled, everyone in school will become maids!

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:57.820
Goal. The winner is number 109, the uniform by Professor Havarov.

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:01.030
Congratulations on your 3rd consecutive victory.

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.610
Why? Why did you betray me?

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:09.330
Actually, I received a request to model from the school affairs department before you asked me.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:14.110
Well, traditions might not be bad for things like this

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:17.410
No way!

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:27.410
How was it, Agarin?

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:29.950
Not bad for entertainment.

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:31.560
That's not what I mean.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.960
I know, Gabuyan...

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:38.300
A demon, but also a god.

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:40.770
A god, but also a demon.

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:43.240
The creator of gods and demons.

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:46.510
The one who tips the scale of the universe.

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:49.170
You are the high,

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:53.800
holy mother, Maria.

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:13.240
The water droplets bounced
mizutama no shizuku ga hanete

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:16.650
a sky colored rythem glitters.
sorairo no rizumu kirari

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:19.830
Follow the tri-colored cat
fukafuka mikeneko ni tsuzuke

00:22:19.830 --> 00:22:22.800
going on a walk.
sanpo ni deyou

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:27.120
Yes, the direction of the fish's tears
sousa sakana no namida no yukue mo

00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:30.460
the rainbow connecting the sky and the city
sora to machi wo tsunagu niji mo

00:22:30.460 --> 00:22:33.500
This world overfilling with questions,
nazonazo ni afureru sekai wo

00:22:33.500 --> 00:22:39.690
shall I take a bite out of it?
hitokuchi tabete miru kana

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:43.840
If I nibble the honey dream,
hachimitsu no yume kajitte

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:48.790
and keep half of it in my pocket,
poketto ni hanbun shimatara

00:22:48.790 --> 00:22:54.230
happiness, I realize the sweetness.
happiness sono amasa ni mezameru

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:57.690
Chasing the jet trail,
hikouki gumo oikakete

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:02.600
the far flying humming
tooku tondeiku humming wa

00:23:02.600 --> 00:23:10.740
is a pastel resounding melody.
pasuteru ni hibiku melodi-

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:14.230
Mu-Mu-Music
myu myu music

00:23:14.670 --> 00:23:17.720
Sun-Sun-Sunshine
sun sun sunshine

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:21.070
Mu-Mu-Music
myu myu music

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:29.000
Eine-san! Congratulations on winning the MaU-con!

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.540
You traitor!

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:32.920
I didn't stand out because of you!

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:37.970
Next time we will surely bring a moe, moe, tsundere exposure episode!

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:39.930
Like we would let you!
